WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:08.110
Renewals due: plans ending within 14 days or in their grace period, and renewal payments.

2
00:00:08.658 --> 00:00:12.860
Review the list and create a "Renewal request" for each person.

3
00:00:13.407 --> 00:00:16.800
Record an in-person payment with "Record payment".

4
00:00:17.346 --> 00:00:23.140
Set automatic reminders in "Membership settings" with "Renewal reminders (days before)".

5
00:00:23.688 --> 00:00:28.590
A member in the grace period can still come; contact them before it ends.
